[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5729466535","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123600#issuecomment-5729466535","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123600","id":5729466535,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVYC4pw","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T11:41:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T11:41:51Z","body":"Overall, I think this is a very good idea. Just two things I'd like to bring up.\r\n\r\n1. \r\nI'm glad you chose to start with `IPAddress` because it exposes something that should be fixed imo (not in this PR). All these sites where the conversion is needed exist because `get_resolve_item_adresses` returns an `Array[String]`, since it is an exposed method. We should not be using that in Core. The exposed method should call some internal method and convert its `List<IPAddress>` into an `Array[String]`, and everything internal should use the `List<IPAddress>` internal method directly.\r\nIf we do that, we may be able to get rid of this conversion code entirely (TBD in follow-up; I may be missing something right now).\r\n\r\n2. \r\n> arguably the conversion definition should be outside variant.h anyway because it's not even a native Variant type.\r\n\r\nShould we make it a design choice to move the conversion templates out of `variant.h`/`variant.cpp` and into the type's own files (i.e., `ip_address.h`/`ip_address.cpp`)? \r\nI personally think yes, to help debloat the Variant files, and I think it's just more correct. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5729466535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5729967501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123600#issuecomment-5729967501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123600","id":5729967501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVYhdjQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T12:26:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T12:27:01Z","body":"> I'm glad you chose to start with `IPAddress` because it exposes something that should be fixed imo (not in this PR). All these sites where the conversion is needed exist because `get_resolve_item_adresses` returns an `Array[String]`, since it is an exposed method. We should not be using that in Core. The exposed method should call some internal method and convert its `List<IPAddress>` into an `Array[String]`, and everything internal should use the `List<IPAddress>` internal method directly. If we do that, we may be able to get rid of this conversion code entirely (TBD in follow-up; I may be missing something right now).\r\n\r\nThat might be a nice refactor, but i think unless someone is actively working in the area, i wouldn't go out of my way to implement it. I'm not sure there's currently any maintainer who'd review that pull request.\r\n\r\n> > arguably the conversion definition should be outside variant.h anyway because it's not even a native Variant type.\r\n> \r\n> Should we make it a design choice to move the conversion templates out of `variant.h`/`variant.cpp` and into the type's own files (i.e., `ip_address.h`/`ip_address.cpp`)? I personally think yes, to help debloat the Variant files, and I think it's just more correct.\r\n\r\nI think that's worth doing eventually, to reduce the include bloat of `variant.h`. But I'd defer that discussion until it's actually feasible.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5729967501/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5834872016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123600#issuecomment-5834872016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin